---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Steven Clarke - Senior Software Engineer focused on media supply chain and complex systems."
>
  <section class="space-y-6">
    <header class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400">
        About
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Pragmatic engineer with broad consulting experience.
      </h1>
      <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        I am a senior software engineer who builds media supply-chain applications and complex
        systems. My consulting background gives me breadth across many organizations and problem
        domains, and I focus on turning ambiguous requirements into specific, deliverable solutions.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What I bring</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          <li>Deep technical work on media supply-chain applications under real constraints.</li>
          <li>Stakeholder management and requirement clarification with cross-functional teams.</li>
          <li>Delivery of complex solutions with attention to tradeoffs and maintainability.</li>
          <li>
            Adaptability to new technology, including agentic AI workflows and LLMs, grounded in
            pre-AI software engineering experience.
          </li>
          <li>A collaborative, curious approach that keeps focus on solving the right problem.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Location & focus</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
          Open to senior software engineering roles, with flexibility for relocation to Austin, TX,
          Seattle, WA, or Asheville, NC, or remote from those locations.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            class="rounded-full bg-teal-600 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-teal-700 dark:bg-teal-500 dark:hover:bg-teal-400"
            href="/resume.pdf"
          >
            Download resume
          </a>
          <a
            class="rounded-full border border-slate-300 px-6 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition hover:border-teal-600 hover:text-teal-600 dark:border-slate-700 dark:hover:border-teal-400 dark:hover:text-teal-400"
            href="/contact"
          >
            Contact
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
